    WSS --> ORCH
    ORCH --> SD --> SimD --> MD --> WD --> ED --> XD --> EvD

    WD ==>|storm phase| WCA
    SimD ==>|incident| SCA

    WCA ==> HUD
    SCA ==> ROSTER
    HUD -.->|pause when crisis| FTR

    XD -.->|silence/density intents| COMMS
    SD -.->|quest intents| COMMS

